                <p n="1">Prosperity! Fortune!</p>
                
                <p n="2">16th year of the king Rājarāja Rājakesarivarman,</p>
                
                <p n="1-2">who took <supplied reason="explanation"><foreign>koḷ</foreign></supplied> ... [<foreign>meykkīrtti</foreign> (7 <foreign>aṭi</foreign>s) of Rājarāja I Cōḻa]</p>
                
